{"id":"4f78f02a1aad45dd","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-df-zfc-forcing-countable-support-iteration.md","title":"ZFC Forcing Countable Support Iteration","display":"df-zfc-forcing-countable-support-iteration — ZFC Forcing Countable Support Iteration","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-forcing-countable-support-iteration","aliases":["58-df-zfc-forcing-countable-support-iteration","58-df-zfc-forcing8-countable-support-iteration","58-df-zfc-forcing11-countable-support-iteration"],"display":"df-zfc-forcing-countable-support-iteration — ZFC Forcing Countable Support Iteration","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-zfc-countable-support-iteration-system]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-forcing-countable-support-iteration"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-forcing-countable-support-iteration</span><span>58-df-zfc-forcing8-countable-support-iteration</span><span>58-df-zfc-forcing11-countable-support-iteration</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-forcing-countable-support-iteration — ZFC Forcing Countable Support Iteration"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3f578666c473032f\" href=\"?note=3f578666c473032f\" title=\"58-df-zfc-countable-support-iteration-system\">58-df-zfc-countable-support-iteration-system</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec{\\mathbb P},\\delta,\\operatorname{Star},\\operatorname{Supp},\\mathbf1\\in V\">\\(\\vec{\\mathbb P},\\delta,\\operatorname{Star},\\operatorname{Supp},\\mathbf1\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CountableSupportIterationSystem}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{CountableSupportIterationSystem}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3f578666c473032f\" href=\"?note=3f578666c473032f\" title=\"58-df-zfc-countable-support-iteration-system\">58-df-zfc-countable-support-iteration-system</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcingCountableSupportIteration}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcForcing8CountableSupportIteration}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcForcing11CountableSupportIteration}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcingCountableSupportIteration}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcForcing8CountableSupportIteration}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcForcing11CountableSupportIteration}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}countable\\text{-}support\\text{-}iteration}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcingCountableSupportIteration}_S(\\vec{\\mathbb P},\\delta)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\operatorname{Star},\\operatorname{Supp},\\mathbf1\\in V\\;\n\\mathrm{CountableSupportIterationSystem}_S\n(\\vec{\\mathbb P},\\delta,\\operatorname{Star},\\operatorname{Supp},\\mathbf1).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}countable\\text{-}support\\text{-}iteration}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcingCountableSupportIteration}_S(\\vec{\\mathbb P},\\delta)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\operatorname{Star},\\operatorname{Supp},\\mathbf1\\in V\\;\n\\mathrm{CountableSupportIterationSystem}_S\n(\\vec{\\mathbb P},\\delta,\\operatorname{Star},\\operatorname{Supp},\\mathbf1).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}countable\\text{-}support\\text{-}iteration}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcing8CountableSupportIteration}_S(\\vec{\\mathbb P},\\delta)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcingCountableSupportIteration}_S(\\vec{\\mathbb P},\\delta).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}countable\\text{-}support\\text{-}iteration}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcing8CountableSupportIteration}_S(\\vec{\\mathbb P},\\delta)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcingCountableSupportIteration}_S(\\vec{\\mathbb P},\\delta).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}countable\\text{-}support\\text{-}iteration}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcing11CountableSupportIteration}_S(\\vec{\\mathbb P},\\delta)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcingCountableSupportIteration}_S(\\vec{\\mathbb P},\\delta).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}countable\\text{-}support\\text{-}iteration}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcing11CountableSupportIteration}_S(\\vec{\\mathbb P},\\delta)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcingCountableSupportIteration}_S(\\vec{\\mathbb P},\\delta).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Countable support is a limit-stage policy on the whole iteration sequence, so the aliases retain both the system and its ordinal length.  The three implementation witnesses required by the sourced five-place system predicate are existentially hidden, rather than silently dropping its arguments.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb